>>__ Parse.temp_set_grammars $ valOf $ grammarDB {thyname="hol"};
## `slow_tac`

``` hol4
classicalLib.slow_tac : clasetLib.claset -> NTactical.ntactic
```

------------------------------------------------------------------------

Constructs the claset-explicit form of `SLOW_TAC`.

`slow_tac cs` performs depth-first solve-completely search using `cs`. It
retains unsafe-rule alternatives after instantiating alternatives, and
uses dynamic per-goal pruning. There is no depth or node bound.

Unlike `SLOW_TAC`, this interface takes a prepared classical rule set and
returns an ntactic. It does not process theorem-list markers or restrict
the result sequence to its first element.

### Failure

Produces no result when the search is exhausted without a complete proof.
It may diverge; replay failure is reported as an error.

### Example

``` hol4
val slow = classicalLib.slow_tac (clasetLib.the_claset ());
```

